    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "激戦区となった、あるビル街。\nチーム「リリウム」は、\n激しい戦闘を繰り広げていた。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_001",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "突如として現れた、\n竜騎士のような風貌の悪魔と、その配下たち。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_002",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "あまりにも強大な力に、\n一同は苦戦を強いられていた。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_003",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "これほどの力が、予兆もなく現れるなんて……\n何故でしょう。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_004",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810002_sof_normal",
        "chara_icon_label": "C01",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ソフィア",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_001"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "他の悪魔たちは、私たちが抑えるわ。\n二人は、あの竜騎士のような悪魔をお願い！",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_005",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810002_ire_angry",
        "chara_icon_label": "C02",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "イレーヌ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_002"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "任せて！",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_006",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810002_eri_normal",
        "chara_icon_label": "C04",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "エリス",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_004",
        "text_autosec": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "私が、あの竜騎士に接近して\n隙を作ります。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_007",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810002_sut_normal",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "エリスお姉さまは、\nその隙に一気に攻めてください。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_008",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003",
        "chara_icon": "",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": []
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "わかった。お願い！",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_009",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "",
        "chara_icon_label": "C04",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "エリス",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_004"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "TextClose",
      "option": {},
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "頼もしい姉妹（スール）であるステラの背中を見て、\nエリスは、ふと――\n昔の記憶を思い出していた。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_010",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
