    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "鎧の内から現れたのは――\nずっと探し続けていた存在。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_042",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "「マルファ……おねえ……さま？」",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_043",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810002_eri_sad",
        "chara_icon_label": "C04_sad",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "エリス",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_004"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "TextClose",
      "option": {},
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "いままで戦ってきた敵の正体を知り、\nエリスは言葉を失う。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_044",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "その隙に、姿を変えたマルファは、\n刃のただ一振りで、\n二人を圧倒していった。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_045",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "エリスを庇うため、前に出たステラは、\nマルファに追い詰められてしまう。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_046",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
