    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "冷たい視線。\n凶刃が、無情にも突き付けられる。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_047",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "その瞳から、光は失われていた。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_048",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "かつて優しく、頼もしく、\n誰もが憧れた彼女の姿は、\nもう、そこにはない。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_049",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "エリスお姉さまは……ずっとあなたを心配して、\nずっとあなたを想って、探し続けていたんです。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_050",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "Scenarios/Gates/Gate081/<_CARD_ILLUST_>/Icon/Swap/Ico_Sr00810005_sut_normal",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03_2",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "どんなに傷ついても……、どんなに辛くても……\n戦うことを、やめずに。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_051",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03_2",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "あなたが夢見た世界を、\nつくるんだって……",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_052",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03_2",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Talk",
      "args": {
        "text": "それなのに……なぜ……。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_TALK_053",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "autominsec": 0,
        "chara_icon": "",
        "chara_icon_label": "C03_2",
        "chara_icon_actor_ctrls": [],
        "chara_name": "ステラ",
        "chara_name_id": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_TALKER_003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "TextClose",
      "option": {},
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "args": {
        "text": "悲しみと絶望の果てに、\nステラの頬を、\n一筋の涙が静かに伝った。",
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0081_C0005_TXT_054",
        "chain_text": false,
        "type": 0,
